exam: A quantity of {n} {t} is distributed equally among {g} recipients. Determine the number of {t} received by each recipient.
exam: It is given that {a} apportions {n.words} {t} in equal shares among {g.words} friends. Ascertain the magnitude of each share.
exam: Compute the quotient of {n} divided by {g}.
exam: State the number of {t} allotted to each of {g} children, pursuant to an equal division of {n} {t}, no item remaining undistributed.
exercise: Grandma passed away and left {n} dollars to be shared equally among her {g} grandchildren. How many dollars does each grandchild get?
exercise: The old cat was put to sleep, so her {n} cans of food are shared equally among the {g} cats at the shelter. How many cans does each cat get?
